#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:27
msgid ""
"Read the [architecture](../explanation/platform-architecture.md), "
"[integration contract](../design/integration-contracts.md) and [provider "
"assembly contract](../design/provider-assemblies.md)."
msgstr ""
"阅读[架构说明](../explanation/platform-"
"architecture.md)、[接入合同](../design/integration-"
"contracts.md)和[提供者装配合同](../design/provider-assemblies.md)。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:31
msgid "Implement in a reviewable sequence"
msgstr "按可评审的顺序实现"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:33
msgid ""
"Prepare the [fixed source and recursive dependencies](source-checkout.md). "
"Define the new behavior, supported modes, public ownership obligations and "
"rejection boundaries before changing its production implementation."
msgstr "准备[固定源码与递归依赖](source-checkout.md)。改变生产实现前，先定义新行为、支持模式、公共所有权义务和拒绝边界。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:36
msgid ""
"Add and execute a meaningful RED GoogleTest/GoogleMock contract against the "
"current production path. Retain the actual command, nonzero execution and "
"expected failing assertion. Test MMIO/CPU/dependency ports through mocks; "
"Python resolver behavior uses stdlib unittest. A missing tool or compile-"
"only error is not the expected behavioral RED result."
msgstr ""
"为当前生产路径新增并执行有意义的 RED GoogleTest／GoogleMock 合同。保留实际命令、非零执行及预期失败断言。通过 mock 测试 "
"MMIO／CPU／依赖端口；Python 解析器行为使用标准库 unittest。工具缺失或只有编译错误，不能当作预期的行为 RED 结果。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:41
msgid ""
"Add exact `soc.json`/`routes.json` facts and documented provenance. Feed the"
" shared CPU resolver; do not duplicate CPU flags or infer optional features."
" Place MCU implementations under `soc/<vendor>/<family>/` and declare that "
"canonical `source_directory` in the maintained family descriptor. Public "
"family identifiers stay independent of the directory. CPU implementation "
"sources belong under their ISA, such as `arch/arm/cortex_m/`; reviewed "
"cross-vendor register algorithms remain in `soc/common/`."
msgstr ""
"增加精确 `soc.json`／`routes.json` 事实和资料来源。使用共享 CPU resolver，不重复 CPU flags "
"或推断可选能力。MCU 实现放在 `soc/<vendor>/<family>/`，并在维护中的系列描述符声明该规范 "
"`source_directory`。公共系列标识独立于目录。CPU 实现源码按 ISA 归属，例如 "
"`arch/arm/cortex_m/`；经过审查的跨厂家寄存器算法保留在 `soc/common/`。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:48
msgid ""
"Add the family to the explicit maintained provider map in "
"`tools/configure/`. Define supported modes, numerical limits, constructors, "
"rollback and IRQ wiring. Return an explicit frozen `Construction` record, "
"including the private state type and failed-init cleanup responsibility; do "
"not require family-name inference in common generation. Unsupported modes "
"reject; there is no runtime registration or plugin discovery."
msgstr ""
"将家族加入 `tools/configure/` 中显式维护的 provider 映射。定义支持模式、数值限制、构造器、回滚与 IRQ "
"接线。返回明确冻结的 `Construction` "
"记录，包含私有状态类型与初始化失败清理责任；不得要求公共生成器从家族名称推断。不支持的模式直接拒绝，不引入运行时注册或插件发现。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:54
msgid ""
"Add explicit CMake targets and private SDK dependencies. Update declared "
"resolver reconfiguration inputs and the Source SDK required-file closure."
msgstr "增加显式 CMake 目标与私有 SDK 依赖。更新解析器声明的重新配置输入，以及 Source SDK 的必需文件闭包。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:56
msgid ""
"Implement the smallest correct production change. Define an immutable public"
" face with shared readonly ops and independent context. Reuse public Nexus "
"types; keep vendor structures and concrete storage private. Review official "
"HAL/LL reuse before duplicating a vendor state machine. Apply [the official-"
"driver boundary](../design/official-stm32-provider.md) to time, callbacks, "
"cancellation, private dependencies and mode-specific comparison."
msgstr ""
"实施最小正确生产变更。定义不可变公共 face，共享只读 ops，并使用独立 context。复用 Nexus "
"公共类型，厂商结构与具体存储保持私有。复制厂商状态机前，先审查官方 HAL/LL "
"复用。时间、回调、取消、私有依赖与逐模式比较遵守[官方驱动边界](../design/official-stm32-provider.md)。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:62
msgid ""
"Execute GREEN against the real provider. Verify rejection without residual "
"effects, accepted borrow, cancel/deadline, failed drain, quarantine, "
"stop/restart and instance isolation where the mode needs them."
msgstr "对真实提供者执行 GREEN。按模式需要验证无残留效果的拒绝、接受后的借用、取消／截止时间、排空失败、隔离保留、停止／重启和实例隔离。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:65
msgid ""
"Refactor while keeping contracts passing. Link exact ARM fixtures and verify"
" actual resources, handler retention, vector bytes and unselected-driver "
"pruning. Validate an independent relocated SDK consumer and record physical "
"work as not executed."
msgstr ""
"保持合同通过再重构。链接精确 ARM 夹具，验证实际资源、处理函数保留、向量表字节和未选择驱动裁剪。验证独立搬移后的 SDK "
"消费工程，并将实板工作记录为未执行。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:69
msgid ""
"For a component, pass explicit bus, GPIO, time and optional OS ports. Do not"
" create workers, probe devices, invent application roles or supply a maximum"
" object pool. Flash drivers expose physical geometry; persistence and update"
" policy remain external."
msgstr ""
"组件通过显式总线、GPIO、时间和可选 OS 端口工作。不得创建执行任务、探测设备、虚构应用角色或提供最大对象池。Flash "
"驱动暴露物理几何；持久化和升级策略仍在外部。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:73
msgid ""
"Within configuration tools, each family's `contract.py` owns mode "
"capabilities, ABI/limits and family admission policy. Sibling modules import"
" that contract directly; `__init__.py` explicitly exports it with "
"constructors and emitters. The leaf `providers/common.py` owns validation "
"helpers and immutable `Construction`; leaf contracts and common helpers do "
"not import the top-level resolver or emitter. `selection.py` checks cross-"
"domain options, clocks and IRQ policy, `ir.py` adapts typed IR, and "
"`matrix.py` orchestrates support catalogues. The descriptor explicitly lists"
" `configuration_modules`, including `contract.py`, so edits trigger "
"reconfiguration and remain in the Source SDK closure."
msgstr ""
"在配置工具内，每个 family 的 `contract.py` 负责模式能力、ABI／限值和 family "
"准入策略。同级模块直接导入该合同；`__init__.py` 将其与 constructor、emitter 显式导出。底层 "
"`providers/common.py` 负责校验 helper 和不可变 `Construction`；底层合同与公共 helper "
"不导入顶层解析器或 emitter。`selection.py` 检查跨领域选项、时钟和 IRQ 策略，`ir.py` 负责 typed IR "
"适配，`matrix.py` 编排支持目录。descriptor 显式列出包含 `contract.py` 的 "
"`configuration_modules`，使修改触发重新配置并保留在 Source SDK 闭包中。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:83
msgid ""
"The read-only [work-package view](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/maintenance/README.md) "
"connects exact maintained modes to resolver fixtures, selected ops sources "
"and reviewed lifecycle properties. Its entries are navigation, not executed "
"tests or new support declarations. Run actual applicable gates separately."
msgstr ""
"只读[工作包视图](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/maintenance/README.md)将精确维护模式关联到 resolver 夹具、所选 ops "
"源码与已审生命周期性质。视图条目用于导航，不是已执行测试或新增支持声明。实际适用门禁需要另行运行。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:88
msgid "Review performance and ownership"
msgstr "审查性能与所有权"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:90
msgid ""
"Measure the selected empty image and the same fixture after enabling the new"
" mode. Report Flash LOAD, Flash footprint, each RAM domain and reserved "
"task/IO storage separately. Hot IRQ work should directly access its fixed "
"provider; an interface lookup is a cold action. Keep bounded admission and "
"stream metadata operations independent of queue length where their contracts"
" require it."
msgstr ""
"测量所选空镜像和同一夹具启用新模式后的镜像。分别报告 Flash LOAD、Flash 占用范围、各 RAM 域和预留任务／I/O 存储。高频 IRQ "
"应直接访问固定提供者；接口查找属于冷路径。在合同要求时，准入判定和流元数据操作保持有界，并且不随队列长度增长。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/guides/provider-porting.md:96
msgid ""
"A passing host register model proves its modeled software scope. New CPU, "
"Cache, FPU/MVE, security or low-power behavior needs its own actual "
"execution boundary; [platform support](../reference/platforms/support.md) "
"does not infer it from a name."
msgstr ""
"通过的主机寄存器模型只证明其建模的软件范围。新增 "
"CPU、缓存、FPU／MVE、安全或低功耗行为必须建立自己的实际执行边界；[平台支持](../reference/platforms/support.md)不能仅凭名称推导它们。"
